{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/resync(_:discardLocalChanges:initialPresence:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"resync(_:discardLocalChanges:initialPresence:)","extendedModule":"Yorkie","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resync"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Document","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie8DocumentC"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"discardLocalChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"initialPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PresenceData","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie12PresenceDataa"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DroppedChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie13DroppedChangeV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:6Yorkie6ClientC6resync_19discardLocalChanges15initialPresenceSayAA13DroppedChangeVGAA8DocumentC_SbSDySSSe_SEpGSgtYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/resync(_:discardlocalchanges:initialpresence:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resync"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"doc"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Document","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie8DocumentC","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"discardLocalChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"initialPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PresenceData","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie12PresenceDataa","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/PresenceData"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DroppedChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie13DroppedChangeV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DroppedChange"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"doc","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The attached document to recover.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"discardLocalChanges","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Must be "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":". The un-pushed changes are taken out of the queue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and returned instead of being sent again; there is no non-discarding form, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"argument keeps the data loss visible at the call site."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The presence to re-attach with. Defaults to the document’s current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presence, so the user keeps their cursor: presence is not what the server refused."}]}],"name":"initialPresence"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The discarded changes, so the app can report them. Re-applying them is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deliberately not the default.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An auth webhook that starts denying writes mid-session (a locked document, a member"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downgraded to read-only, a revoked share link) leaves the refused changes in the queue."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Push and pull share one RPC, so every later sync re-sends them, is denied again, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client stops receiving other peers’ changes too. The refused changes cannot be undone in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place either: they are already applied to the root and there is no server-confirmed copy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to fall back on. Recovery therefore re-anchors the same "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"server state:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wait out any in-flight sync, then drop offline persistence and take the un-pushed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes out of the queue."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Detach without the presence-clear change a detach normally mints, so the pack carries","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no changes a webhook could refuse and the ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientSeq","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" counter never has to be rewound.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reset the document for re-anchoring and attach it again under the sync mode, garbage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection option and poll interval it had, with the presence it held.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Restart the sync loop that the denial stopped."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Keeping the instance is the point: the app’s subscriptions and the editor bound to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"document survive. Between the discard and the re-anchor the queue has a ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientSeq","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" hole","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no new change may be minted over, so the discard suspends minting: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/update(_:_:)"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/undo()"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/redo()"},{"text":" throw ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errRefused"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/isMintable"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" until the re-anchor. An edit made before the discard is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part of the discarded set and is reported with the rest.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A detach the server refuses restores the queue and leaves the document attached as it was,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the call can be retried. Offline persistence is the exception, as in yorkie-js-sdk: it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is torn down before the detach and stays down until the next attach. Past the detach the changes are gone for good and are published","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/LocalChangesDroppedEvent","isActive":true},{"text":" with reason ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/LocalChangesDroppedValue\/Reason-swift.enum\/writeDenied","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before the re-attach, which can still fail.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole recovery runs under the client’s sync semaphore, so no sync can start or be in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flight while the queue is touched."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Automatic recovery on attach denials and watch denials is not part of this call."}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errClientNotActivated"},{"type":"text","text":" when the client is not active,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errNotAttached","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when the document is not attached,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errInvalidArgument","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when ","type":"text"},{"code":"discardLocalChanges","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"error of the detach or the re-attach.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recovers a document whose local writes the server has refused, without dropping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client and the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DroppedChange":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DroppedChange","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DroppedChange"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DroppedChange"}],"type":"topic","title":"DroppedChange","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/droppedchange","abstract":[{"text":"One un-pushed local change that offline persistence could not reconcile with the server.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Document/isMintable":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/isMintable","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isMintable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"isMintable","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/document\/ismintable","abstract":[{"text":"Whether this document may queue a new local change.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Client"}],"abstract":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a normal client that can communicate with the server.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has documents and sends changes of the documents in local"},{"type":"text","tex